      "math_academy_id": "e-4435",
      "problem": "Calculate $\\det(A),$ if ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/aea3a71194c641b7aaba317564932b5ad6ce8f198bc4aca555eb684e856d5727.svg)",
      "worked_solution": "For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14272902/assets/43294727d65a8147ce11dcafceb5ad2d4e629b6a46e14c5d6b3f08b4a530cf1d.svg)\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{3}-(-2)\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
